 average of 2.6M. It didn't hold. By Sep 23, 2025 it had closed below the breakout level three days running, and the chart ends at $77.12.","lesson":"This is an example of a failed breakout where everything looked right, volume included, and the stock fell back anyway. It happens. This is why traders cut losses fast instead of hoping."}}